  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Introduction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Bambu Lab Stickers are crafted for creators, designers, and 3D printing enthusiasts, offering a fun and easy way to personalize your gear. Made from high-quality PVC, these stickers are durable and can be applied to a variety of surfaces, like 3D printers, models, laptops, and more. They’re lightweight, easy to use, and can be removed without leaving any residue, allowing you to add a touch of personality to your projects and tools."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Product Feature"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Lightweight and easy to use | Waterproof and scuff-resistant | High quality PET"
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<p></p>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Introduction</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<p>Bambu Lab Stickers are crafted for creators, designers, and 3D printing enthusiasts, offering a fun and easy way to personalize your gear. Made from high-quality PVC, these stickers are durable and can be applied to a variety of surfaces, like 3D printers, models, laptops, and more. They’re lightweight, easy to use, and can be removed without leaving any residue, allowing you to add a touch of personality to your projects and tools.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 模型表格 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 99.9987%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 41.9171%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Models</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 12.7413%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Creators</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 44.8716%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Model Links</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 12.7413%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Need Other Accessories</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 41.9171%;\">\n<div>\n<div data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-zone-id=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<div>\n<div data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-zone-id=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\">1:16 scale Formula One Model Car, F1</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 12.7413%; text-align: center;\">@NotKuro</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 44.8716%; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/615305-1-16-scale-formula-one-model-car-f1#profileId-540938\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\">1:16 scale Formula One Model Car, F1</span></stron